    "Id": "chassisdef_dyrnwyn_DYR-D",
    "Name": "Dyrnwyn",
    "Details": "The D configuration of the Dyrnwyn OmniMech is designed to face infantry, mostly using four Machine Guns in each arm. Its Nova CEWS helps it detect infantry, a Laser AMS reduces any incoming missile attacks, and two Medium Pulse Lasers deal with other enemies. Like every Dyrnwyn, it combines jump jets with an advanced Partial Wing System, giving it exceptional mobility that only a truly skilled MechWarrior can fully exploit.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
